note One frame: the elapsed time, begin, the app's frame, render, and then the Input is cleared of everything that was momentary. The frame is timed here and the count, the worst and how many went over 16 ms accumulate on the runner, which is the only measurement of smoothness the tool has. Whatever the frame asked for becomes the next redraw deadline, a cursor different from the last one is set on the window, and a frame that asked to quit exits the loop.

